---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Sarvagun Siksha Abhiyan" description="Value education, life skills, career counseling, and debate workshops in government schools of Dehradun, Uttarakhand.">
  <section class="py-16 lg:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[var(--spacing-page)] px-4 lg:px-6">
      <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-heading font-bold mb-6">Sarvagun Siksha Abhiyan</h1>
      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-text-muted space-y-4">
        <p>Sarvagun Society is running <strong>"Sarvagun Siksha Abhiyan"</strong> in which the society organizes workshops and classes on Value Education, Life Skills, Career Counselling, and Debate Competitions in various government schools of Dehradun.</p>

        <p>The motive behind these classes is to provide value-based education in government schools, as the students in these schools belong to underprivileged sections of society and they hardly get exposure to such classes.</p>

        <p>Till present date, these classes are being regularly conducted by experienced and trained volunteers of the society, and <strong>more than a thousand students</strong> are getting benefited by these classes.</p>

        <div class="bg-primary/5 border border-primary/20 rounded-lg p-6 not-prose">
          <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-lg text-primary mb-3">We Need Volunteers!</h3>
          <p class="text-text-muted text-sm">Society needs more volunteers who can devote a few hours in a week to conduct these classes in government schools. If you're interested, <a href="/members/volunteers" class="text-primary hover:text-primary-hover underline">join us as a volunteer</a>.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
